289
00:11:11,421 --> 00:11:14,600
Why is an electric hypercar so heavy,

290
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:16,147
and still so fast?

291
00:11:16,327 --> 00:11:17,627
The battery is heavy.

292
00:11:17,807 --> 00:11:21,080
A battery stores much less energy per

293
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:23,380
kilogram than petrol does.

294
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:27,137
To travel a useful distance at hypercar

295
00:11:27,137 --> 00:11:30,989
power, the car needs hundreds of kilograms

296
00:11:30,989 --> 00:11:31,815
of cells.

297
00:11:31,995 --> 00:11:34,522
The Nevera weighs over two tonnes,

298
00:11:34,522 --> 00:11:36,975
much more than a petrol supercar.

299
00:11:37,325 --> 00:11:38,666
In a straight line,

300
00:11:38,666 --> 00:11:41,278
the huge power and the instant torque

301
00:11:41,278 --> 00:11:43,606
more than make up for the weight.

302
00:11:43,786 --> 00:11:45,911
But weight hurts in corners,

303
00:11:45,911 --> 00:11:48,036
