304
00:11:48,216 --> 00:11:51,558
That is why electric hypercars still use

305
00:11:51,558 --> 00:11:53,229
carbon fibre bodies,

306
00:11:53,229 --> 00:11:57,073
light materials and clever suspension to fight

307
00:11:57,073 --> 00:11:58,827
every extra kilogram.

308
00:11:59,177 --> 00:12:03,011
Engineers are working on batteries that store

309
00:12:03,011 --> 00:12:05,310
more energy in less weight,

310
00:12:05,310 --> 00:12:07,525
such as solid state cells.

311
00:12:07,705 --> 00:12:09,064
If they succeed,

312
00:12:09,064 --> 00:12:13,055
electric hypercars will become lighter and even

313
00:12:13,055 --> 00:12:13,649
faster.

314
00:12:13,829 --> 00:12:15,951
Today, they are fast in spite of

315
00:12:15,951 --> 00:12:16,813
their weight.

316
00:12:16,993 --> 00:12:19,706
Tomorrow, they may be fast and light

317
00:12:19,706 --> 00:12:20,987
at the same time.

318
00:12:21,336 --> 00:12:22,590
So here are the ten.

319
00:12:22,770 --> 00:12:25,845
A motor that gives all its force

320
00:12:25,845 --> 00:12:26,613
at once.

321
00:12:26,793 --> 00:12:29,359
Four motors that control each wheel.

322
00:12:29,539 --> 00:12:31,587
A battery in the floor for a

323
00:12:31,587 --> 00:12:33,196
low centre of gravity.

324
00:12:33,376 --> 00:12:36,000
One gear for one smooth surge.

325
00:12:36,180 --> 00:12:38,797
An inverter that turns your foot into

326
00:12:38,797 --> 00:12:39,292
