327
00:12:39,472 --> 00:12:41,503
Cells built for power.

328
00:12:41,683 --> 00:12:44,539
Cooling that decides how long it lasts.

329
00:12:44,719 --> 00:12:47,564
Flat motors that pack more force.

330
00:12:47,744 --> 00:12:50,066
Tyres that set the real limit.

331
00:12:50,246 --> 00:12:52,169
And a heavy battery that the car

332
00:12:52,169 --> 00:12:52,951
